      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“比赛结束后，我跟美冬约好了。\n我努力比赛，她努力滑冰，彼此都要做出成果，\n下次见面时要带着满满的自信！”",
      "source_fingerprint": "f53e845b065b486ae69afe7184180563da1ab740d29fa580e3fdd8b907e97b8d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
